        // the whale (its middle at d = 0, its head to the left): a long_ body, its back and belly curved, tapering to the
        // stock of its tail, a forked fluke, a long_ flipper under its chest, an eye, the grooves along its throat;
        // paler than the water, its belly paler again, inked round
